Drop your gold just below going down the stairs.  Explore the level.  If
there is a shop or shrine on the level retrieve your gold to spend it. 
If not only retrieve your gold from the previous level when you finish
exploring the current one.  Again drop it just before descending.

For that matter if you find a ton of gold on the current level like from
a magic memory vault drop it near the down stairs.  Leprechauns don't
pick gold up from the floor that I remember.  Hmmm, maybe take it up one
lever.

This way you never lose more than the gold you found on the current
level.


